/*
 * break-quarto-md.ts
 *
 * Breaks up a qmd file into a list of chunks of related text: YAML
 * front matter, "pure" markdown, triple-backtick sections, and so on.
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2021-2022 Posit Software, PBC
